  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Song Yi Shi demands vengeance on Xing Xiang Zi, Song Qi Yuan offers to send her uncle Song Xia Qi to help her since he must lead the clan against Cai clan and Ruo Lai clan for Old Eccentric Tian Nan’s inheritance. Song Xia Qi’s body is filled with a vigorous aura, and at twin polar sea strait he tells Song Yi Shi the token will let her uncle Song Jia Dan sense them. When Song Jia Dan cannot deduce Xing Xiang Zi’s location, Song Xia Qi presses him, calling him elder cousin, and observes that the target is only a rank six lone cultivator from Northern Plains. He smiles bitterly at Song Jia Dan’s humility about his own attainment.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_yi_shi",
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "inh_tian_nan_true_inheritance",
        "char_song_jia_dan",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Song Yi Shi and Song Xia Qi return to twin polar sea strait, Song Jia Dan again greets them as Little Shi and cousin Xia Qi. Song Xia Qi explains they have come about Tian Nan’s inheritance at Ascending Heaven Plain, then tells Jia Dan that Wisdom Star is a Northern Plains Gu Immortal and Tai Bai Yun Sheng’s friend who could be employed by Song clan before Ruo Lai clan or Cai clan act first. After Jia Dan fails to deduce Wisdom Star and instead warns of the danger other forces pose to Ascending Heaven Plain, Song Xia Qi praises his cousin’s wisdom.",
      "chapters": [
        987
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seeking-a-deduction-on-wisdom-star",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_eccentric_tian_nan",
        "loc_ascending_heaven_plain",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "fac_song_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Xia Qi is a rank seven Gu Immortal of Song clan, stationed at qi sea as the clan’s representative. Qi Sea Ancestor requests Old Eccentric Tian Nan’s true inheritance for his descendants’ refinement path development, and Song Xia Qi answers that the request is too large for him to decide alone and that Song clan has been researching the inheritance since it obtained it, guessing the reply will disappoint. Qi Sea Ancestor lets the matter drop and serves him new triple layered qi tea; Song Xia Qi then reports the exchange to Song clan’s headquarters, and when Song Qi Yuan asks how Qi Sea Ancestor took the refusal, he answers that the ancestor gave up quickly with no change in attitude. Song clan’s Gu Immortals debate the risk of offending Qi Sea Ancestor as leader of the Righteous Qi Alliance before deciding to keep the inheritance regardless.",
      "chapters": [
        2102
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
